  src: '{"name":"dining_chair_sunroom_3","prefab":"Assets/Classic Wooden Furniture Pack/Prefabs/CHAIR_01.prefab","x":[7.58,8.1],"z":[4.27,4.76],"y0":0.0,"height":0.97,"yaw":180,"back":"","hides":[],"collide":true,"source":"Dining room (overnight Oct 18, prop, not walked; spec/dressing/dining.json): owned Classic Wooden Furniture Pack CHAIR_01 at native size (0.52 x 0.49 x 0.97) as a STAND-IN for the film''s eight Chippendale chairs (246/252: pierced splat backs, dark mahogany; furniture-sourcing D2, the user may buy them); three a side and one at each end, pulled up to the cloth''s edge (2.5 cm clear of its skirt)"}'
