  src: '{"name":"den_desk","prefab":"Assets/Fadnn - Vintage Interior Furniture Pack/Props/Prefabs/HDRP/SM_Desk_01.prefab","x":[7.837,9.049],"z":[19.046,19.766],"y0":0.0,"height":0.78,"yaw":359.0,"back":"","hides":[],"collide":true,"source":"Den (Oct 16, TRIAL, changes/2026-10-16-den.json, DEVIATIONS 53): Fadnn Vintage Interior (owned; furniture-plan N5/N6). Marina''s writing table at the front window (f153: legs z 18.41-18.99, x 8.03-8.79; centred z ~18.7, ~0.4 m off the window wall). Her table is smaller with cabriole legs; the pack''s pedestal desk (1.61 x 0.94) fitted to 1.2 x 0.7 x 0.78 (x0.75/0.74/0.91), drawers to the room (yaw 270 = native +Z front to spec -x)","scale":[0.745,0.906,0.747],"placed_by":"user"}'
