  src: '{"name":"dining_sideboard","prefab":"Assets/Classic Wooden Furniture Pack/Prefabs/DRAWER_CAB_01.prefab","x":[4.85,6.35],"z":[3.044,3.524],"y0":0.0,"height":0.86,"back":"-z","hides":[],"collide":true,"source":"Dining room (overnight Oct 18, prop, not walked): the film''s sideboard (246/252: under the gilt still life, left of the sunroom French doors, a brass tea service on it; 10548 its brass chafing dish beside the kitchen door). Owned DRAWER_CAB_01 (1.14 x 0.39 x 0.70 native) fitted to 1.50 x 0.48 x 0.86 (x1.32/1.23/1.23; sideboard standard 34 in), back 4 cm off the sunroom wall (wainscot cap 3 cm proud + 1), its rear end 0.59 m from the kitchen wall","yaw":180}'
